Copyright 2026 ViralForge contributors

This product includes original work only:

- Product illustrations (serum, tote, lamp) are original SVG authored for this project.
- Demo films are rendered locally from original DOM compositions via Playwright and FFmpeg.
- Demo BGM beds are synthesized locally with numpy; no third-party samples.
- Reference frames are self-made simulations and are labelled as such in the UI.
- No Hypit code, AGPL code, third-party footage, music, or portrait is included.

The name "ViralForge" and the project identity are used for this open-source project.
